    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Gridbreakers</strong></p><p><strong>“Everything broken still remembers how it worked.”</strong></p><p>Gridbreakers treat dead cities like sleeping machines. They know how to pry power from broken substations, wake lights in abandoned towers, and make a ruin choose sides. Where others see debris, they see leverage.</p><p><em>You’ve learned the first law of a dead city: if it still sparks, it still negotiates.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Investigation and the Tinkering aptitude.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> In Ruins or Urban Wreckage hexes, salvage and material recovery are easier and more reliable.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
